# Restless Reef enters tapped on turn 1. On turn 3 Bot1 pays {2}{U}{B} with four Moxen and animates it: until end of turn it
# is a 4/4 blue and black Shark land creature with deathtouch (CR 613.1d, 613.4b). Attacking, it targets Bot2: "target
# player mills four cards" - four Lightning Bolts go to Bot2's graveyard (their library 20 - 7 - 1 - 4 = 8). Bot2 blocks
# with Sheoldred, the Apocalypse (4/5): Reef's 4 damage is less than her toughness, so only deathtouch kills her; her own
# deathtouch kills Reef. Bot1 lost 2 life drawing with Sheoldred in play (18).

